div.p:
Americans number 1,928, natives and half-castes, 40,612; Chinese, 
 15,301; Japanese, 12,360; Portuguese, 8,602;
                    British, 1,344; Germans, 1,034; French, 70; Norwegians, 227; Polynesians, 588;
                    and other foreigners 419.

The minister of finance informs me that the taxes paid by Americans and Europeans
                    amount to$274,516.74; those by natives, $71,386.82; half-castes, $26,868.68;
                    Chinese, $87,266.10; Japanese, $67,326.07; other nationalities, $729.82.
